{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/Wishlist.gif?t=1749656302\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Next addition to the <strong>Beach Invasion</strong> game series, this time bringing the players to defend against the greatest amphibious operation during the <strong>First World War</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/enemies.gif?t=1749656302\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> In this FPS/Tower defense game,  players defend the beach fortifications against invading forces who will attack your position with troops, armored cars, biplanes, planes and more! Use a variety of iconic and authentic WWI weapons stretching from machine guns to coastal artillery, and field cannons to anti-air guns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/WEAPONS.gif?t=1749656302\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Beach Invasion 1915-Gallipoli</strong> brings  modern FPS realism to arcade style on-rail shooter game mechanics. The players can choose to play two scenarios; in the first as a Turkish soldier\u00a0  defending the beaches of Gallipoli, in the second one as a British soldier defending the Suez Canal. Moreover they can play together with friends in online <strong>CO-OP gamemode</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/ARTY.gif?t=1749656302\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During these immense amphibious  operations,  player's task is to destroy as many of the invading forces as possible in continous waves, utilizing a variety of weapons and bonuses from the supply drops, such as\u00a0Poison Gas, Armor Piercing, Explosive and Incendiary ammunition. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compared to previous games in the franchise, players can now determine the <strong>precise location</strong> of where they want the <strong>artillery fire</strong> to hit. <strong>New enemies</strong> include infantry who will  charge with their <strong>bayonets</strong>, <strong>armored cars</strong>, <strong>motorcycles</strong>,  <strong>bi-planes</strong> and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3556670?t=1749656302","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3556670?t=1749656302","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/58337307aabf0f4a9e7eb597bd7bd5eae07c12ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749656302","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/58337307aabf0f4a9e7eb597bd7bd5eae07c12ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749656302","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood and mild-gore when shooting soldiers"},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3775410,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/Wishlist.gif?t=1749656302\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Next addition to the <strong>Beach Invasion</strong> game series, this time bringing the players to defend against the greatest amphibious operation during the <strong>First World War</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/enemies.gif?t=1749656302\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> In this FPS/Tower defense game,  players defend the beach fortifications against invading forces who will attack your position with troops, armored cars, biplanes, planes and more! Use a variety of iconic and authentic WWI weapons stretching from machine guns to coastal artillery, and field cannons to anti-air guns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/WEAPONS.gif?t=1749656302\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Beach Invasion 1915-Gallipoli</strong> brings  modern FPS realism to arcade style on-rail shooter game mechanics. The players can choose to play two scenarios; in the first as a Turkish soldier\u00a0  defending the beaches of Gallipoli, in the second one as a British soldier defending the Suez Canal. Moreover they can play together with friends in online <strong>CO-OP gamemode</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/ARTY.gif?t=1749656302\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During these immense amphibious  operations,  player's task is to destroy as many of the invading forces as possible in continous waves, utilizing a variety of weapons and bonuses from the supply drops, such as\u00a0Poison Gas, Armor Piercing, Explosive and Incendiary ammunition. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compared to previous games in the franchise, players can now determine the <strong>precise location</strong> of where they want the <strong>artillery fire</strong> to hit. <strong>New enemies</strong> include infantry who will  charge with their <strong>bayonets</strong>, <strong>armored cars</strong>, <strong>motorcycles</strong>,  <strong>bi-planes</strong> and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["AIx2 Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/864977b6fa6ab9959bdfcbf1bd97f419385a4db9/header.jpg?t=1749656302","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257155420,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155420/movie480.mp4?t=1749647437","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155420/movie_max.mp4?t=1749647437"},"name":"\u00c7anakkale","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257155420/ffe14d4dc023d8355f1343725f9a82ef584e01a7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749647437","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155420/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749647437","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155420/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749647437"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257148803,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148803/movie480.mp4?t=1749656299","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148803/movie_max.mp4?t=1749656299"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257148803/5d2fccda10f1585555e52f74c5e2203bfd07b3fc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749656299","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148803/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749656299","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148803/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749656299"}}],"name":"Beach Invasion 19